{
  "namespace": "DT_MapRespawnPointInfoText",
  "fields": {
    "SpawnPoint_1": "G\u00FCzel bir manzaras\u0131 ve bol miktarda kayna\u011F\u0131 olan k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk bir tepe.\r\nYeni oyuncular i\u00E7in \u00F6nerilir.",
    "SpawnPoint_1_Title": "R\u00FCzg\u00E2rl\u0131 Tepeler - Ba\u015Flang\u0131\u00E7lar\u0131n Platosu",
    "SpawnPoint_2": "\u00C7evresinde pek \u00E7ok su Pal\u0027\u0131n\u0131n oldu\u011Fu bir kumsal.\r\nFazla a\u011Fa\u00E7 yoktur ama pek \u00E7ok Pal buray\u0131 evi bilir.",
    "SpawnPoint_2_Title": "R\u00FCzg\u00E2rl\u0131 Tepeler - U\u00E7an Bal\u0131k Sahili",
    "SpawnPoint_3": "Her y\u00F6n\u00FCnde resifler bulunan bir k\u0131y\u0131 \u015Feridi.\r\nOrta miktarda kaynak ve Pal\u0027lar i\u00E7erir.\r\nKayal\u0131k bir yer olmas\u0131na ra\u011Fmen geni\u015F, a\u00E7\u0131k bir toprak par\u00E7as\u0131 bulmak kolayd\u0131r.",
    "SpawnPoint_3_Title": "\u0130mbat Tak\u0131madalar\u0131 - Resif",
    "SpawnPoint_4": "Keyifli bir imbata ev sahipli\u011Fi yapan g\u00FCne\u015Fli adalar.\r\nBir volkan\u0131n yak\u0131n\u0131ndad\u0131r ve s\u0131cak, ya\u015Famas\u0131 kolay bir iklimi vard\u0131r.\r\nAna adan\u0131n merkezine kolay bir eri\u015Fim sunan bu yer, maceralara \u00E7\u0131kmak i\u00E7in harika bir yerdir.",
    "SpawnPoint_4_Title": "\u0130mbat Tak\u0131madalar\u0131 - Kazazede Kumsal\u0131",
    "SpawnPoint_5": "Ana adan\u0131n uzaklar\u0131ndaki bu adada hi\u00E7 kimse ya\u015Fam\u0131yor gibidir.\r\nTak\u0131madalar\u0131n en kuzey ucunda yer al\u0131r ve s\u0131cakl\u0131klar biraz d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCkt\u00FCr.\r\nEv sahipli\u011Fi yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 \u00E7ok az Pal ve kaynak sebebiyle burada ya\u015Famak zordur.",
    "SpawnPoint_5_Title": "Unutulmu\u015F Ada",
    "SpawnPoint_6": "Karl\u0131 da\u011Fdan gelen so\u011Fuk r\u00FCzg\u00E2rlar adan\u0131n her yerinde eser.\r\nGeceleri \u00E7\u00F6ken so\u011Fuk \u00F6l\u00FCmc\u00FCl olabilir.\r\nTak\u0131madalarda do\u011Fup b\u00FCy\u00FCyen ki\u015Filer bile buraya yerle\u015Fmeyi pek d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCnmez.",
    "SpawnPoint_6_Title": "Buz R\u00FCzg\u00E2r\u0131 Adas\u0131",
    "SpawnPoint_7": "Do\u011Fuda kalan vah\u015Fi bir ada.\r\nAna adan\u0131n kenar\u0131nda bulunur. Buray\u0131 imar etmek kimsenin akl\u0131na gelmemi\u015Ftir.\r\nVah\u015Fi do\u011Fada ya\u015Famaya al\u0131\u015Fmam\u0131\u015F ki\u015Filerin burada hayatta kalmas\u0131 zordur.",
    "SpawnPoint_7_Title": "Do\u011Fu Yaban Adas\u0131",
    "SpawnPoint_8": "Geni\u015F batakl\u0131klara ev sahipli\u011Fi yapan bir ada.\r\nIl\u0131man iklimi sayesinde her yerde meyveler bulunabilir.\r\nAna adan\u0131n merkezine iyi bir eri\u015Fim sunar.",
    "SpawnPoint_8_Title": "Batakl\u0131k Adas\u0131",
